documentation/design/research-goals/memory-handoff-2026-11-07.md:3:Written at the researcher's request after the v8 result, when five simple questions showed that "the memory goal is met" did not match the memory the researcher's claims need. This file replaces nothing. The [2026-11-04 memory goal](memory-goal-2026-11-04.md) and every run, report and gate stay unchanged as history. Read this file first before any new memory work.
